  <NewLine UId="112" />
  <Comment Inserted="true" UId="113">
    <MultiLanguageText Lang="de-DE" />
    <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-GB" />
    <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">
The function block calculates the moving average value (averageValue) of the input values that are entered.
Each time the block is called, the value (x) currently present is saved in an array.
The values stored in the array are deleted upon deactivation of the function block.
The function block is activated via the input enable and calculates values from that instant.
The output maxValueReached is set if the amount of values in an array reaches the defined number sizeOfArray.
</MultiLanguageText>
